# Personal OS — API Keys Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real keys.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# ─── Add your tools below ────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: TOOLNAME_API_KEY=your_key_here
# See references/connections-guide.md for setup instructions
# See references/{tool}-api.md for where to find each key

# Examples:
# AIRTABLE_API_KEY=pat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# NOTION_API_KEY=secret_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# GMAIL_CLIENT_ID=xxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
